SSES) or counsel's to read first.\\\\nNEVER_RETRIED_CLASSES = (\\\\\\\"question\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"claims-boundary\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"gate\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"environment\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef _budget_stage(stage: str, stop_class: str | None) -> str:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"The stage whose [drive].attempts budget a stop spends -- build for\\\\n    a returned review (the check rejection or the blocking finding is the\\\\n    build's to answer, never the review's own to repeat), the stop's own\\\\n    stage for everything else.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    return \\\\\\\"build\\\\\\\" if stop_class == \\\\\\\"returned\\\\\\\" else stage\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef _signatures_match(records_dir: Path, stage: str) -> bool:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Whether the last two attempts of stage carry the id\\n1018 {\\\"type\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"message\\\":{\\\"role\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"tool_use_id\\\":\\\"toolu_012AWzjUkdnAgKZYpnQUmCxW\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_result\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"The file /Users/davidbean/Projects/attavo-worktree-219/attavo/drive.py has been updated successfully.\\\"}]},\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"ae622d81-efb9-4dda-92a0-5ebf75b0d73f\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"9cbb628e-3660-498b-bcb3-d5c3f8a2365e\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-09-26T03:37:49.155Z\\\",\\\"tool_use_result\\\":{\\\"filePath\\\":\\\"/Users/davidbean/Projects/attavo-worktree-219/attavo/drive.py\\\",\\\"oldString\\\":\\\"def _advance_again(root: Path, m: dict[str, Any], item_id: str, stage: str, head: str | None) -> int:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"`--again`'s own act on a stopped stage: exactly what next-build or\\\\n    next-review would do, bypassing the level a plain pass leaves alone\\\\n    for the operator. A review reads the forge fresh here -- once, since\\\\n    the report's own stopped reading never touched it -- rather than\\\\n    reusing a read that was never taken.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    if stage == \\\\\\\"build\\\\